[Chapter "Without c4"]
[Line "Against the Veresov (2.Nc3 and Bg5)"]
[Opening "Richter-Veresov Attack: Two Knights System"]

{White pins the f6 knight. Black supports it and stays solid.} 1. d4 d5 {Claim the centre.} 2. Nc3 Nf6 {Develop.} 3. Bg5 {The Veresov: the bishop pins the f6 knight.} 3... Nbd7 {Support the f6 knight, so Bxf6 can be met with ...Nxf6.} 4. Nf3 e6 {Solid: ...Be7 and castling come next.} *
